[{"id":14986,"name":"Speckled Stroke &#038; Coat\u00ae Kit #2 Pints","slug":"sp-kt2p-speckled-stroke-coat-kit-2-pints","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/www.maycocolors.com\/product\/sp-kt2p-speckled-stroke-coat-kit-2-pints\/","sku":"SP-KT2P","short_description":"<p>Contains 12 pint jars of the best selling Speckled Stroke &amp; Coat\u00ae glazes.<\/p>\n<p>Includes:<br \/>\nSP-216 Speckled Cotton Tail<br \/>\nSP-206 Speckled Sunkissed<br \/>\nSP-245 Speckled My Blue Heaven<br \/>\nSP-211 Speckled Blue Yonder<br \/>\nSP-212 Speckled Moody Blue<br \/>\nSP-213 Speckled Grapel<br \/>\nSP-270 Speckled Pink-A-Dot<br \/>\nSP-274 Speckled Hot Tamale<br \/>\nSP-227 Speckled Sour Apple<br \/>\nSP-226 Speckled Green Thumb<br \/>\nSP-254 Speckled Vanilla Dip<br \/>\nSP-215 Speckled Tuxedo<\/p>","description":"<p>Performing just as their counterpart, Speckled Stroke &amp; Coat\u00ae glazes are an enhanced version of popular Stroke &amp; Coat\u00ae colors. The addition of small specks of color to the base glaze provides a fun visual interest that does not melt or flow during the 06 glaze firing. Stroke &amp; Coat\u00ae is the industry&#8217;s most versatile product. It can be applied on wet clay, earthenware bisque or stoneware bisque, fired from cone 06 to cone 10, in oxidation or reduction and used in every decorative way imaginable. Use these glazes to create intricate, detailed designs. Colors can butt up to one another without moving and when used in a majolica process, Stroke &amp; Coat\u00ae will not move nor blend with the colors beneath even when using light over dark. Stroke &amp; Coat\u00ae colors are intermixable, allowing artists to create custom shades. Thin with water or media to create a wash or watercolor style of design. Because the liquid color is consistent with the fired color, artists will have no trouble visualizing finished results as they create. Stroke &amp; Coat\u00ae fires glossy without clear glaze and is opaque with two to three coats. Because of its versatility, Stroke &amp; Coat\u00ae and Speckled Stroke &amp; Coat\u00ae is the ideal product of choice for studio, classroom, potter or fine artist.<\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"23800","regular_price":"23800","sale_price":"23800","price_range":null,"currency_code":"USD","currency_symbol":"$","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"$","currency_suffix":""},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">&#036;<\/span>238.00<\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":20444,"src":"https:\/\/www.maycocolors.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/sp-kt2p.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/www.maycocolors.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/sp-kt2p-300x300.jpg","srcset":"https:\/\/www.maycocolors.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/sp-kt2p.jpg 633w, https:\/\/www.maycocolors.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/sp-kt2p-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.maycocolors.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/sp-kt2p-100x100.jpg 100w, https:\/\/www.maycocolors.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/sp-kt2p-600x600.jpg 600w, https:\/\/www.maycocolors.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/sp-kt2p-150x150.jpg 150w","sizes":"(max-width: 633px) 100vw, 633px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/www.maycocolors.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/sp-kt2p-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.maycocolors.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/sp-kt2p-100x100.jpg 100w, https:\/\/www.maycocolors.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/sp-kt2p-600x600.jpg 600w, https:\/\/www.maycocolors.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/sp-kt2p-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/www.maycocolors.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/sp-kt2p.jpg 633w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px","name":"sp-kt2p","alt":""}],"categories":[{"id":95,"name":"Color","slug":"color","link":"https:\/\/www.maycocolors.com\/product-category\/color\/"},{"id":98,"n